{"id":"925588f7d7cb9abb","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product.md","title":"ZFC Setop Cartesian Product","display":"df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product — ZFC Setop Cartesian Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product"],"display":"df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product — ZFC Setop Cartesian Product","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product — ZFC Setop Cartesian Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,P,p,a,b\\in V\">\\(A,B,P,p,a,b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\)</span>（Kuratowski 有序对编码，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本原子定义的笛卡尔积谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}product}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S(P,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(p\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,a,b)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}product}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S(P,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(p\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,a,b)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该定义把有序对落实为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\">\\(\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\\)</span>，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\times B\">\\(A\\times B\\)</span> 在 ZFC 中是一个集合。</li>\n<li>“指标族的乘积”是函数集合，语义不同，不应作为二元笛卡尔积的上游依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S$（Kuratowski 有序对编码，见 [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,P,p,a,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}product}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S(P,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\;\\Bigl(p\\in P\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;\\exists b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,a,b)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\times B","display":false}],"bytes":1177,"backlinks":[{"id":"59c214549033bde1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4afc8517bfa0c07e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S$ (Cartesian-product predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3470","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product.md|58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","c7cf057d5daacec1"]}